{"id":"656689","name":"香菇青菜鸡蛋炒麻糍","author":"清水淡竹","authorId":"8451954","desc":"","cover":"images/656689/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"酱肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"麻糍","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"酱肉切片。","img":"images/656689/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"胡萝卜、香菇、青菜改刀切好。","img":"images/656689/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡蛋加盐、料酒打散。","img":"images/656689/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"麻糍切小块。","img":"images/656689/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"平底锅刷油，放入麻糍小火煎软。","img":"images/656689/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"两面煎黄。","img":"images/656689/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入蛋液。","img":"images/656689/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煎好滑散。","img":"images/656689/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"另起一锅加少许油，放入酱肉煸炒出油。","img":"images/656689/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"先放入胡萝卜翻炒一会。","img":"images/656689/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入菜帮和香菇翻炒片刻。","img":"images/656689/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入菜叶炒软。","img":"images/656689/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入煎好的麻糍和葱段，加盐、少许蚝油调味炒匀。","img":"images/656689/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/656689/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}